raph\" >Collect clues and speak to NPCs to gather information about the growing influence of various cults competing amongst each other for power and influence, each one planning to summon a different OLD GOD to wreak havoc upon the fragile new nation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375520/extras/02ba60ecca2247360f3b644363a20024.avif?t=1744566117\" width=100 height=80 /></span>\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375520/extras/c21a8485acc5c89a6428bef4f55cd64f.avif?t=1744566117\" width=100 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
